Smart Gates, Tolls and Safety Buffers (SGSB) v4.1.4
Quick Reference Guide — "Weigh Station Balance & Fleet Flow"

Target Environment: American Truck Simulator (ATS)

Target Master File Paths:

    /unit/hookup/animated_gate.sii

    /def/world/trigger_action.sii (Weigh Station & Toll Compliance)

    /unit/hookup/animated_gate.dlc_*.sii (State DLC Overrides)

    /unit/hookup/parked_vehicle.sii (Fleet & Parking Density)

Compatibility: ATS Base Map, All State DLCs, & Major Map Combos (ProMods / Reforma)
[1] Core Parameter Standards — Gates & Colliders

    Universal High-Speed Approach Range: Standardized down or locked to 125.0m across Illinois (dlc_il), New Mexico (dlc_nm), and Texas (dlc_tx) panorama, underground, and construction fence gates.

    Extended Trailer Clearance Range (Oregon): 135.0m (metal_01 heavy metal storage door) to prevent late-opening trailer tail-swing clipping.

    Pneumatic & Short-Range Industrial Range: Increased from 15.0m to 17.0m across Kansas (ag_ks_salt, ag_ks_air), Montana (ag_mt_gfll), Oklahoma (ag_pf_busf), and Wyoming (ag_wy_mine, ag_wy_ref) for smoother activation pacing.

    Guard-Check / Security Range: 20.0m (Borders, Ports, Mines).

    Stop-and-Go Range: 25.0m (Cash Toll Ramps, River Locks, Floodgates).

    Collider Geometry Enforcement: Explicit .pmc physical collider file verification (Fixed .pmg path errors on ag_nv_wstg and ag_suncrops).

[2] Weigh Station & Scale Compliance Controls (v4.1.4 New Addition)

    Target File: /def/world/trigger_action.sii

    Check Probability (trig_action.weigh / trig_action.weigh_req): Reduced from vanilla 60% (0.6) down to a realistic 20% (0.2) check rate.

    Toll Preservation: Integrated full native toll definitions (trig_action.toll_exit, trig_action.toll_mid) to ensure zero toll booth breakage while modifying scale frequencies.

[3] Dynamic Parking & Fleet Density Optimizations (v4.1.4 Additions)

    Global Density Bump: Clean 7% spawn weight multiplier applied across all vehicle classes to populate empty background lots and scenic turnouts without duplication spam.

    Broadened Time Windows: Replaced hard 0.0 drop-offs with low "bleed-over" probability values across day and night cycles to eliminate dawn/dusk pop-in.

    Municipal Night Shift Flipped: City sweepers and garbage trucks (Mack RD and standard units) locked to the graveyard shift with nighttime probabilities (0.85), lowering daytime presence.

    Render Distance Optimization: Integrated engine parameter uset g_lod_factor_parked "1.1" to pull background culling distances out just far enough to catch parked assets before entering the immediate field of view.

    AI Traffic Purge: Stripped all legacy configuration blocks and fallback references for the deprecated traffic.tesla unit.

